OL,3,AMilitary base asylum plans granted
OL,4,Aplanning approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning permission to house asylum
OL,7,Fseekers at a former military site near
OL,8,Fthe Oxfordshire village of Piddington
OL,9,Fhas been granted by the government.
OL,11,FThe Home Office's application to house
OL,12,Fup to 1,256 men at the MoD Bicester
OL,13,Fsite was fast-tracked using an Urgent
OL,14,FCrown Development application.
OL,16,FThe nearby village of Piddington
OL,17,Fsymbolically voted to leave the UK in
OL,18,Fopposition to the planned site, which
OL,19,Fhas also been legally challenged by
OL,20,Fcampaigners.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
